WEBVTT

00:00:29.413 --> 00:00:31.621
Tasavvur qilish orqali
kelajakni ko’rish,

00:00:34.662 --> 00:00:36.121
o’tmishga qaytish mumkin.

00:00:38.746 --> 00:00:40.871
Hozirgi lahza chegarasini 
tark etish va

00:00:40.871 --> 00:00:43.871
narsalarga boshqalarning nazari 
bilan qaray olishimiz mumkin.

00:00:45.496 --> 00:00:48.204
Ijod qilish orqali biz arxitekturamizni,

00:00:49.537 --> 00:00:50.912
ilmiy isbotlarni va

00:00:52.371 --> 00:00:54.037
san’at asarlarimizni yaratamiz.

00:00:54.621 --> 00:00:56.746
Biz bu dunyoda nafaqat yashaymiz,

00:00:56.746 --> 00:01:01.371
balki sivilizatsiyalar, farazlar, 
texnologiyalar yaratamiz,